# Hub design kit

Before any UI work on a hub (new site or an edit), read `AGENTS.md` and use `css/tokens.css`, `css/overlays.css`, `css/chrome.css`, and `snippets/`.

- Do not invent colours, type sizes, radii, or button styles.
- Per-hub differences are overlay only: `data-hub="teaching|life|knowledge|tasks"` (glass / tile density). Tasks clones Teaching; see `TASKS.md`.
- After changing kit CSS, run `scripts/sync-to-hubs.sh`.
